-**Parameters:**
--   `renderMpr`: A boolean flag indicating whether MPR layers should be rendered before the volume ray casting for the current segment [S1].
--   `VOI priority number`: An integer assigned to each VOI to determine rendering order in overlapped regions. Higher priority overwrites lower priority. Multiple VOIs may share identical priorities, in which case their contributions are blended [S1].
--   `Default VOI`: The implicit bounding box of the volume dataset, assigned the lowest priority. Voxels excluded by all other VOIs are rendered according to this default [S1].
